Most surprising hobby project
<p>lively-mascot. Two stars hides a surprisingly mature 61-commit semantic =
animation engine. The useful invention is not its cartoon cat; it is separa=
ting <code>what the character is doing emotionally</code> from <code>how th=
is particular rig physically renders it</code>.</p>

Fastest integration win
<p>Define the ten canonical Roast.pet reactions in lively-mascot-style reci=
pe JSON and make the existing sprite actor consume them. This requires no m=
odel downloads, inference, customer data or paid API calls and immediately =
tests whether choreography can become durable data.</p>

