e abstraction Roast.pet needs between AI/comedy direction and a replaceable=
 visual renderer.</p>

Architecture implication
<p>The emerging Roast.pet stack should separate three durable objects:</p>
<ol>
<li><code>pet.json</code> =E2=80=94 identity, canonical texture, landmarks/=
geometry.</li>
<li><code>performance.json</code> =E2=80=94 semantic comedy state + timed p=
art-level actions.</li>
<li>renderer adapter =E2=80=94 sprites / affine micro-rig / Live2D / I2V.</=
li>
</ol>
<p>Then the roast script can say <code>Fred performs deadpan_disbelief at 2=
.4s</code> without knowing whether Fred is currently rendered as sprites or=
